**Eumosa** (/' *ymɔsa* /, [[eumosa|Eumosa]]: *𐐅𐑋𐐫𐑅𐐴*) is the language spoken in the areas of [[lairebais|Lairebais]], [[khegh-yaen|Khegh Yaen]], [[kiseryn|Kiseryn]] and [[xoseon-steppes|Xoseon Steppes]].
